│ Issue Title: [BUG] ToolUsage not using same I18N as Agent                                                                                       │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ Description:                                                                                                                                    │
│ ### Description                                                                                                                                 │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ The ToolUsage class defaults to using I18N() and has no way to update it. It should use the same I18N as the agent so that custom prompt_file's │
│ work properly.                                                                                                                                  │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ ### Steps to Reproduce                                                                                                                          │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ 1. Make a new prompt file (like translation/en.json) and edit the `tool_usage_exception` message.                                               │
│ 2. Set your crew to use this new prompt_file.                                                                                                   │
│ 2. Have an agent use a tool incorrectly.                                                                                                        │
│ 3. Observe that the error message sent to the AI does not contain the update from 1.                                                            │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ ### Expected behavior                                                                                                                           │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ The tool error message sent to the AI contains the updated wording from the prompt_file                                                         │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ ### Screenshots/Code snippets                                                                                                                   │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ <img width="711" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/30cdbb04-2e46-43de-b84c-faa6e30ee52b">                             │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ I18N does not use a custom prompt_file.                                                                                                         │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ <img width="611" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/aa4049b2-7c31-4628-9974-d7e6fc893788">                             │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ When ToolUsage is created, there is no way to set the prompt_file.                                                                              │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ ### Operating System                                                                                                                            │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ macOS Sonoma                                                                                                                                    │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ ### Python Version                                                                                                                              │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ 3.10                                                                                                                                            │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ ### crewAI Version                                                                                                                              │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ 0.70.1                                                                                                                                          │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ ### crewAI Tools Version                                                                                                                        │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ 0.12.1                                                                                                                                          │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ ### Virtual Environment                                                                                                                         │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ Conda                                                                                                                                           │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ ### Evidence                                                                                                                                    │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ Screenshots above show that the I18N never uses the prompt_file property set on the crew in ToolUsage and has no way of being set.              │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ ### Possible Solution                                                                                                                           │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
